...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

script: 스크립트 (main) { class: ours }
verify: CodeVerification { class: ours }
anthropic: Anthropic Claude { class: ext }
outfile: 결과 파일 (index.html) { class: file }

script -> verify: execute(requirements, code)
verify -> anthropic: 코드+요구사항
anthropic -> verify: verified_code
verify -> script: verified_code
script -> outfile: 코드 블록 쓰기(index.html)
